EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I'll make this short. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}There are two
ways to make a lot of Bells around
here, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
First, by catching insects and fish.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
So buy a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fishing rod{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} and a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}net{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
You can sell what you catch.
Second, by digging wherever you
see those  marks. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Buy a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}shovel{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
and then get to work.
You can sell your finds at {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Re-Tail{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},
but you can also donate them to
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Blathers{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
He wants bugs, fish, and other
special things for his museum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}That owl's got a good heart.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
But he won't pay you a single Bell.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Are you the charitable type?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}We're getting ahead of ourselves.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Buy yourself a net, a fishing rod,
and a shovel.{{TAG:000A:0012:46004700480049004A00}}

